cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: tRNAgraph
abstract: >-
  tRNAgraph is a tool for advanced analysis of tRNA-seq data. It builds an AnnData
  object from a tRNA-seq processing run and provides read classification, coverage
  analysis, clustering, differential expression and visualization on top of it.
type: software
authors:
